sequenceDiagram
  participant K as Kafka
  participant W as Ingest Worker
  participant N as Normalizer
  participant API as CIRDA API
  participant DB as PostgreSQL

  K->>W: raw JSON batch
  W->>N: normalize(raw)
  N->>API: POST /ingest/events/batch
  API->>DB: upsert evidence + edge
  API-->>W: IngestBatchResult
